# Canonical author identities for `git shortlog` / `git log` / GitHub's contributor views.
#
# Elad committed under two identities — the GitHub noreply address the web UI signs commits with, and the
# Technion campus address configured on his machine. Without this file `git shortlog -sn` lists them as two
# people ("Elad Nachalieli" and "eladn"), which both undercounts his contribution and invents a fourth
# contributor on a three-person project — exactly the number a grader checking per-member commits reads.
# Mapping is metadata only: no commit is rewritten and no hash changes.
